      <p class="muted">Last updated: 29 September 2026</p>

      <p>This Privacy Policy explains how <b>Stand Digital DOO</b> (“we”, “us”, “our”) collects,
        uses and protects information in connection with the <b>Mini Girly Games</b> mobile
        application (the “App”). By downloading or using the App, you agree to the practices
        described here.</p>

      <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
      <p>The App is owned and operated by Stand Digital DOO, Soloćuša bb, Srebrenica 75430,
        Republika Srpska, Bosnia and Herzegovina (VAT 405016490002). If you have any questions,
        you can reach us any time at
        <a href="mailto:contact@stand-digital.com">contact@stand-digital.com</a>.</p>

      <h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
      <p>We designed Mini Girly Games to be fun first and privacy-friendly. We do <b>not</b> ask you
        to create an account or provide your name, address or phone number to play. Depending on how
        you use the App, the following information may be collected:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><b>Gameplay &amp; device data:</b> basic technical information such as device type,
          operating system version, language, app version, crash reports and anonymous usage
          statistics that help us fix bugs and improve the games.</li>
        <li><b>Advertising &amp; analytics identifiers:</b> if the App shows ads or uses analytics,
          our partners may process device identifiers to measure performance and, where permitted,
          show relevant ads.</li>
        <li><b>Purchase information:</b> if you make an in-app purchase, the transaction is handled
          by Apple or Google. We receive confirmation that a purchase occurred but never your full
          payment card details.</li>
        <li><b>Messages you send us:</b> if you email us, we keep your message and contact details so
          we can reply and provide support.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. How we use information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To operate, maintain and improve the App and its mini games.</li>
        <li>To diagnose technical problems, fix crashes and keep the App secure.</li>
        <li>To understand which games are popular so we can create more of what you love.</li>
        <li>To show and measure advertising that keeps the App free to play.</li>
        <li>To respond to your questions and support requests.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Children’s privacy</h2>
      <p>Mini Girly Games is intended for a general audience and is meant to be family-friendly.
        We do not knowingly collect personal information from children in a way that would require
        verifiable parental consent. Where the App is directed to children or used by children, we
        aim to limit data collection to what is necessary to run the App and, where ads are shown,
        to use only child-appropriate, non-personalized advertising. If you are a parent or guardian
        and believe your child has provided us with personal information, please contact us at
        <a href="mailto:contact@stand-digital.com">contact@stand-digital.com</a> and we will delete it.</p>

      <h2>5. Sharing your information</h2>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share limited information with trusted
        service providers who help us run the App, such as:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>App stores (Apple App Store, Google Play) for downloads and purchases;</li>
        <li>Analytics and crash-reporting providers;</li>
        <li>Advertising partners (where advertising is used);</li>
        <li>Authorities, where required by law.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>These providers may only use the information to perform services on our behalf.</p>

      <h2>6. Advertising choices</h2>
      <p>Where personalized ads are used, you can limit ad tracking through your device settings
        (for example, “Allow Apps to Request to Track” on iOS or “Ads” settings on Android).</p>

      <h2>7. Data retention &amp; security</h2>
      <p>We keep information only for as long as needed for the purposes described above, and we use
        reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect it. No method of transmission or
        storage is 100% secure, but we work hard to safeguard your data.</p>

      <h2>8. Your rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct or delete your
        personal information, or to object to certain processing. To make a request, email us at
        <a href="mailto:contact@stand-digital.com">contact@stand-digital.com</a>.</p>

      <h2>9. Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will revise the “Last
        updated” date above and, where appropriate, notify you within the App.</p>

      <h2>10. Contact us</h2>
      <p>Questions about privacy? We’re happy to help.<br>
